# Scripted input for compose_window_clipboard.kt's window (KLIO_WIN_INPUT): an
# event as the platform would report it, at the given milliseconds after the
# window's first event poll. Key codes are AWT's (A 65, C 67, V 86, X 88);
# "menu" is the platform's menu shortcut modifier.
# Click into the first field, Select All, Copy.
200ms move 50 20
200ms press 50 20
200ms release 50 20
300ms key 65 97 menu
400ms key 67 99 menu
# Click into the second field, Paste twice.
500ms move 50 60
500ms press 50 60
500ms release 50 60
600ms key 86 118 menu
700ms key 86 118 menu
# Back in the first field, Select All and Cut.
800ms move 50 20
800ms press 50 20
800ms release 50 20
900ms key 65 97 menu
1000ms key 88 120 menu
